            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">average diode production technology, comprising the diode wafer production (cleaing, masking, etching, doping, oxidising, metal deposition) and the final assembly of the diode (wafer sawing, die bonding, moulding, trimming and forming)\n\n# Included processes\nThis module includes auxillary and energy consumption, emissions (air, water) and waste amounts, as well as an estimation of the efforts for transportation and of the infrastructure for the production of diodes.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
